WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.922
These are the main habits from Module 13.

00:00:02.922 --> 00:00:05.702
Keep the relational thinking you built earlier.

00:00:05.702 --> 00:00:12.782
Add distributed cost awareness. Use raw files, temporary views, and Delta tables deliberately.

00:00:12.782 --> 00:00:14.432
Inspect plans. Validate outputs.

00:00:14.432 --> 00:00:20.977
And match the tool to the workload instead of assuming Spark is always better.

00:00:20.977 --> 00:00:23.972
Do not treat this as a list to memorize.

00:00:23.972 --> 00:00:27.822
Try to explain each idea using one example from a project you understand.

00:00:27.822 --> 00:00:32.092
If you can describe when you would use the concept, what assumption it makes,

00:00:32.092 --> 00:00:37.749
and how you would validate the result, you are ready to apply it independently.
